    "1 deseeded and thinly sliced chilli,",
    "1/2 cm piece of root ginger cut into slithers,",
    "6 prepared scallops halved horizontally,",
    "1/2 tsp dark soy sauce,",
    "roughly chopped coriander,",
    "a few drops of sesame oil."
  ],
